.DS_Store
.DS_Store

# Ignore SQL dumps and loose markdown (repo docs live under documentation/)
*.sql
*.md
!documentation/
!documentation/**/*.md

# CLAUDE.md is the entry point for the codebase and must be tracked.
!CLAUDE.md

# The schema baseline IS the schema (see documentation/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md).
# It is not a dump to be ignored -- without it the database cannot be rebuilt.
!database/schema/
!database/schema/*.sql

# One-off cleanup / data-fix scripts run by hand on the server. These are
# reviewed changes, not dumps -- an unreviewed DROP TABLE is exactly what
# should not be pasted into a production shell from someone's Downloads.
!database/sql/
!database/sql/*.sql

# External reference materials (not part of the product)
final-web---dp-world-esg-2024-eng-v3.pdf
reference-material/

# Marketing website — separate deliverable, not part of the Laravel app
/WEBSITE/
